@startuml Replica_Sync_Mechanism
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

package "Leader Broker" {
    component "Leader Partition" as LP #E8F5E8
    component "Leader Log" as LL #E3F2FD
    database "Log Segments" as LS1 #F1F8E9
}

package "Follower Broker 1" {
    component "Follower Partition 1" as FP1 #F3E5F5
    component "Follower Log 1" as FL1 #FFF3E0
    database "Log Segments" as LS2 #F1F8E9
    component "ReplicaFetcherThread 1" as RFT1 #FCE4EC
}

package "Follower Broker 2" {
    component "Follower Partition 2" as FP2 #F3E5F5
    component "Follower Log 2" as FL2 #FFF3E0
    database "Log Segments" as LS3 #F1F8E9
    component "ReplicaFetcherThread 2" as RFT2 #FCE4EC
}

' 数据流向
LP --> LL : "append records"
LL --> LS1 : "write to segments"

RFT1 --> LP : "FetchRequest(offset, maxBytes)"
LP --> RFT1 : "FetchResponse(records, HW)"
RFT1 --> FP1 : "append fetched records"
FP1 --> FL1 : "append to log"
FL1 --> LS2 : "write to segments"

RFT2 --> LP : "FetchRequest(offset, maxBytes)"
LP --> RFT2 : "FetchResponse(records, HW)"
RFT2 --> FP2 : "append fetched records"
FP2 --> FL2 : "append to log"
FL2 --> LS3 : "write to segments"

' 状态更新
FP1 --> LP : "updateFollowerFetchState()"
FP2 --> LP : "updateFollowerFetchState()"
LP --> LP : "maybeIncrementLeaderHW()"

note right of LP
    Leader 处理：
    • 接收 Follower 拉取请求
    • 返回日志数据和高水位
    • 更新 Follower 状态
    • 重新计算高水位
    • 检查 ISR 扩展/收缩
end note

note left of RFT1
    Follower 拉取：
    • 定期发送 FetchRequest
    • 指定起始偏移量和最大字节数
    • 处理 FetchResponse
    • 追加到本地日志
    • 更新 LEO 和状态
end note

note bottom of LS1
    同步特性：
    • 异步复制：Follower 主动拉取
    • 批量传输：提高网络效率
    • 压缩支持：减少网络传输
    • 错误重试：网络异常自动重试
    • 偏移量跟踪：精确的进度管理
end note
@enduml